demo/            A small but complete suite.  Run it with:

                     perl ../bin/lit.pl -v demo

                 One test (expected-failure.test) is marked XFAIL on
                 purpose, so a clean run reports 5 passed and 1
                 expectedly failed.

openvms-lit.cfg  An annotated suite config for a compiler test suite on
                 OpenVMS, showing --param, native path substitutions and
                 the host-provided architecture features.
